### Rotas de teste (extensão REST Client do VS Code). Rode antes: npm run sync && npm run seed

### 1. Login com senha errada (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@logistica.com", "senha": "errada" }

### 2. Login válido (guarda o token)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@logistica.com", "senha": "123456" }

### 3. Rota privada sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas

### 4. Cadastrar funcionário
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "nome": "Novo Funcionário", "email": "novo@logistica.com", "senha": "123456" }

### 5. Cadastrar motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "nome": "Pedro Santos", "cnh": "45678901234", "cpf": "44455566677", "telefone": "48999990004" }

### 6. Cadastrar motorista com CPF inválido (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "nome": "Teste", "cnh": "45678901234", "cpf": "123", "telefone": "48999990004" }

### 7. Listar motoristas (CNH/CPF descriptografados)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Buscar motorista por nome
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas?nome=ana
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 9. Consultar motorista por código
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 10. Atualizar motorista
PUT http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "nome": "João Silva Jr.", "cnh": "12345678901", "cpf": "11122233344", "telefone": "48911112222" }

### 11. Excluir motorista com carga (409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 12. Cadastrar carga
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "descricao": "Móveis", "peso": 300, "volume": 5.5, "codigoRastreio": 100004, "idMotorista": 1 }

### 13. Cadastrar carga com motorista inexistente (404)
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "descricao": "Móveis", "peso": 300, "volume": 5.5, "codigoRastreio": 100005, "idMotorista": 999 }

### 14. Listar cargas
GET http://localhost:3000/cargas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 15. Cadastrar entrega
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "cidadeDestino": "Blumenau", "status": "TRANSITO", "dataHora": "2026-10-30T09:00", "idCarga": 1 }

### 16. Atualizar status da entrega
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "status": "ENTREGUE" }

### 17. Atualizar entrega inexistente (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{ "status": "ENTREGUE" }

### 18. Listar entregas ordenadas por data (crescente)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=asc
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 19. Listar entregas ordenadas por data (decrescente) apenas TRANSITO
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=desc&status=TRANSITO
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
